<title>USA: Florsheim names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Florsheim names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florsheim Group Inc said Thursday it appointed Karen Nyman Latham as vice president and chief financial officer. She fills a vacancy created by the November departure of Larry Svoboda.</p>
<p>Latham previously was vice president-treasurer of Vigoro Corp, which recently was acquired by IMC Global Inc.</p>
<p>Florsheim also said it named Carolyn Most to the new position of vice president of licensing worldwide. She will be based in the footwear company's New York office.</p>
<p>In addition, it named Lynn Wade to the new position of director of corporate services.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
